# WiFi Mask Attack Patterns for Hashcat
# Common WiFi password structures (8-12 chars)
# ?l=lowercase ?u=uppercase ?d=digit ?s=special ?a=all
#
# Ordered by probability (most common patterns first)

# 8-digit numeric (ISP defaults, PINs)
?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d

# Word(cap) + 4 digits (e.g., Password1234)
?u?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?d?d

# 8 lowercase letters
?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l

# Word(cap) + 3 digits (e.g., Dragon123)
?u?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?d

# Word(cap) + 2 digits (e.g., Michael99)
?u?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?d

# 10-digit numeric
?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d

# 9-digit numeric
?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d?d

# lowercase + 3 digits
?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?d

# lowercase + 4 digits
?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?d?d

# Word(cap) + year (e.g., Jessica2024)
?u?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?d?d

# 6 lowercase + 2 digits
?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?d

# All lowercase 9
?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l

# All lowercase 10
?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?l

# Word + special + digits
?l?l?l?l?l?l?l?s?d?d

# Uppercase + lowercase + digits (complex)
?u?l?l?l?l?l?d?d?s

# 8 hex chars (ISP defaults)
?h?h?h?h?h?h?h?h

# 10 hex chars
?h?h?h?h?h?h?h?h?h?h

# Word(cap) + 1 digit + special
?u?l?l?l?l?l?l?d?s
